SHA256Core.lean — kernel-timing evaluator (protocol constraints).
Nat words with % 2^32 masking. Fixed 8-word State and 16-word Block.
Structural recursion / let-sharing only. No Array, UInt32, BitVec,
WellFounded.fix, typeclass hot-path, sorry, admit, native_decide.

Lean 4.32.2 `Nat.land`/`lor`/`xor` depend on `propext`. Protocol §2
requires empty `#print axioms`, so 32-bit bitwise ops are unrolled
let-sharing definitions (axiom-free, flat reduction).
-/

